    "en": {
      "name": "Mart, Knight of the Winter Raven",
      "effect": "You can send 1 other card from your hand or field to the GY; place this card face-up in its owner's Spell & Trap Zone as a Continuous Spell, and if you do, Special Summon up to 2 \"Winter Raven\" monsters with different names from each other from your Deck, except \"Mart, Knight of the Winter Raven\". When a monster declares an attack and this card is a Continuous Spell: You can target 1 \"Winter Raven\" Monster Card in your Spell & Trap Zone; Special Summon it. You can only use each effect of \"Mart, Knight of the Winter Raven\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
